<!-- CONSTRUCTION EXPERTISE -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="tag">Construction Specialists</span>
      <h2>Built for How <span>Contractors Actually Work</span></h2>
      <p>Generic bookkeepers treat a construction company like any other business. It isn't. Here's what we handle that they don't.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card fade-up">
        <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-hard-hat"></i></div>
        <h3>Job Costing</h3>
        <p>Costs tracked to the job and phase, so you know which projects actually made money — not just whether the month did.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card fade-up">
        <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i></div>
        <h3>WIP Schedules</h3>
        <p>Work-in-progress reporting with over/under billings calculated properly — the schedule your bonding company and lender expect.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card fade-up">
        <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-file-invoice-dollar"></i></div>
        <h3>AIA Billing</h3>
        <p>G702/G703 progress billing packages prepared correctly the first time, so pay applications don't come back rejected.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card fade-up">
        <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-percentage"></i></div>
        <h3>Retainage Tracking</h3>
        <p>Retainage receivable and payable tracked separately, so you always know what's being held and when it's due for release.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card fade-up">
        <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-balance-scale"></i></div>
        <h3>Revenue Recognition</h3>
        <p>Percentage-of-completion or completed-contract, applied under US GAAP and matched to how you actually bill.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card fade-up">
        <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-hammer"></i></div>
        <h3>Your Existing Stack</h3>
        <p>We work inside Procore, Buildertrend, and JobTread alongside QuickBooks — no rip-and-replace of tools your crews already use.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="author-bio" style="margin-top:48px;">
      <div class="author-bio-avatar">DC</div>
      <div class="author-bio-info">
        <h4>CA Devendra Choudhary</h4>
        <span>Founder, FinRise Advisors</span>
        <p>I'm a Chartered Accountant (ICAI) with 8+ years in outsourced accounting and construction finance for US businesses. When you work with FinRise you deal with me directly — not an account manager relaying questions to someone else. If your WIP schedule doesn't tie out or your job costs aren't telling you the truth, that's the conversation I want to have.</p>
        <a href="/contact-us" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:18px;">Book a Free Consultation <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

